"Prefix items with 1-9, 0, A-Z; pressing the key pastes the item without the mouse. Hold ⇧ while the menu is open for the extended menu: every history item gets a submenu with all actions — paste as plain text, UPPERCASE, single line, copy only, add to Templates, delete. For the latest item the submenu also shows the global shortcuts that do the same without the menu." = "项目前加 1-9、0、A-Z；按下对应键即可不用鼠标粘贴。菜单打开时按住 ⇧ 进入扩展菜单：每个历史项目都会出现包含全部操作的子菜单——以纯文本粘贴、大写、合并为一行、仅复制、添加到模板、删除。对于最新项目，子菜单还会显示无需菜单即可完成相同操作的全局快捷键。";
