"Clipboard history, templates, settings, the password and the Touch ID key are deleted; the example templates come back. The app, its permissions and Launch at login stay. There is no undo — export a backup first if you may want the data back." = "将删除剪贴板历史、模板、设置、密码和 Touch ID 密钥；示例模板会恢复。应用、其权限和登录时启动保持不变。无法撤销——如果以后可能需要数据，请先导出备份。";
"Reset puts Keepit back to a fresh install — history, templates, settings, password and Touch ID key are deleted and the example templates return; the app and its permissions stay. Uninstall does the same and then removes the app, Launch at login, the keychain entry and the Accessibility permission. Both ask for your password or Touch ID; Uninstall also for a typed confirmation. Export a backup first if you may want the data back." = "“重置”将 Keepit 恢复为全新安装状态：删除历史、模板、设置、密码和 Touch ID 密钥，恢复示例模板；应用及其权限保留。“卸载”在此基础上再移除应用、登录时启动、钥匙串条目和辅助功能权限。两者都需要密码或 Touch ID；卸载还需要键入确认。如果以后可能需要数据，请先导出备份。";
"Recovery Access…" = "恢复访问…";
"Updates" = "更新";
"Check for updates automatically" = "自动检查更新";
"Once a day Keepit asks GitHub Releases whether a newer version exists — the only network request it makes; the download itself is signed and verified. Off = no request is ever made and Check for Updates… leaves the menus; you update by downloading from keep.it.com." = "Keepit 每天向 GitHub Releases 查询一次是否有新版本——这是它发出的唯一网络请求；下载本身经过签名和验证。关闭 = 永不发出请求，“检查更新…”从菜单中消失；可从 keep.it.com 下载更新。";
